      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.46,
          "end": 6.01,
          "en": "So can we use provide inject also for custom events?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.01,
          "end": 8.05,
          "en": "The answer is yes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.05,
          "end": 11.8,
          "en": "but by implementing that a bit differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.8,
          "end": 14.85,
          "en": "We don't have a similar mechanism for events,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.85,
          "end": 19.63,
          "en": "But we can think about this event thing differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.63,
          "end": 22.72,
          "en": "Ultimately, when a custom event is emitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.72,
          "end": 25.63,
          "en": "we at some point connect a method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.63,
          "end": 29.03,
          "en": "here in App dot Vue in this case, which should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.03,
          "end": 30.173,
          "en": "upon this event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.72,
          "end": 35.64,
          "en": "Well, of course, we could also pass such a method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.64,
          "end": 40.48,
          "en": "with props down to the component where it should be called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.48,
          "end": 45.43,
          "en": "So we could remove this SelectTopic custom event here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.43,
          "end": 48.49,
          "en": "on knowledge base in App dot view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 48.49,
          "end": 51.86,
          "en": "And we could then go to Knowledge-Base",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.86,
          "end": 55.29,
          "en": "and therefore remove it here as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.29,
          "end": 59.793,
          "en": "and removed is emits option and the same in knowledgeGrid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 60.64,
          "end": 64.117,
          "en": "Remove this listener here on the KnowledgeElement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 64.117,
          "end": 66.653,
          "en": "and remove this emits option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 67.59,
          "end": 71.2,
          "en": "And in knowledgeElement where we emit this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 71.2,
          "end": 76.03999999999999,
          "en": "also not emitted here, but instead do something else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 76.03999999999999,
          "end": 79.85,
          "en": "Instead here, we could expect to get the function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 79.85,
          "end": 83.43,
          "en": "that should be called when the button is pressed as props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 83.43,
          "end": 87.4,
          "en": "or in this case, as an injected value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 87.4,
          "end": 91.12,
          "en": "So we can add inject here, and then simply expect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 91.12,
          "end": 95.17699999999999,
          "en": "any key of our choice any name we pick, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 95.17699999999999,
          "end": 96.17699999999999,
          "en": "SelectTopic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 97.72999999999999,
          "end": 99.25,
          "en": "but this name is up to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 99.25,
          "end": 102.423,
          "en": "and then bind this here to the click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 103.63,
          "end": 106.58,
          "en": "So I expect that select topic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 106.58,
          "end": 110.3,
          "en": "the value which I get injected here is a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 110.3,
          "end": 111.13300000000001,
          "en": "in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 111.13300000000001,
          "end": 114.81,
          "en": "A function, which is then executed when this click occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 114.81,
          "end": 116.282,
          "en": "So I point at a function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 116.282,
          "end": 119.45,
          "en": "and I want to get this function as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 119.45,
          "end": 121.863,
          "en": "for this Provide inject mechanism.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 123.43,
          "end": 126.95,
          "en": "Now injecting it is not enough, we also need to provide it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.95,
          "end": 129.54,
          "en": "So we can go to App dot view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.54,
          "end": 132.28,
          "en": "And there we now need to provide that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 132.28,
          "end": 135.43,
          "en": "Now we got function that should be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.43,
          "end": 138.17000000000002,
          "en": "for activating a topic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 138.17000000000002,
          "end": 141.29,
          "en": "And that is our ActivateTopic method here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.29,
          "end": 145.73,
          "en": "So we can provide this SelectTopic key,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.73,
          "end": 147.72,
          "en": "because that's the key I'm listening to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 147.72,
          "end": 151.1,
          "en": "in KnowledgeElement. That's the key I'm injecting there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 151.1,
          "end": 153.12,
          "en": "so it's the key I want to provide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 153.12,
          "end": 157.57999999999998,
          "en": "and the value for that is this activateTopic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.57999999999998,
          "end": 161.62,
          "en": "So I'm pointing at this method. I'm not executing it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.62,
          "end": 164.27,
          "en": "I'm just pointing at it to let you know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.27,
          "end": 168.862,
          "en": "hey, that method here, ActivateTopic, that is the method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.862,
          "end": 172.2,
          "en": "and therefore the function you should provide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.2,
          "end": 174.823,
          "en": "as a value for SelectTopic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 176.18,
          "end": 178.73,
          "en": "And then when SelectTopic is injected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.73,
          "end": 180.72,
          "en": "here in KnowledgeElement,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.72,
          "end": 182.963,
          "en": "We can execute it in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 183.97,
          "end": 187.33,
          "en": "Now keep in mind that activatesTopic wants to know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.33,
          "end": 191.86,
          "en": "which ID we selected. So therefore, in KnowledgeElement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.86,
          "end": 194.08,
          "en": "where I'm pointing at selectTopic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 194.08,
          "end": 197.35,
          "en": "as a to be executed function when this is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 197.35,
          "end": 200.487,
          "en": "I should make sure that this ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.487,
          "end": 204.71,
          "en": "which we're getting as a prop conveniently, is provided.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 204.71,
          "end": 207.07,
          "en": "So I'm now calling it myself telling view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 207.07,
          "end": 210.42000000000002,
          "en": "that this is how the function should be called eventually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.42000000000002,
          "end": 214.46,
          "en": "and that this ID should be provided to the function we get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 214.46,
          "end": 215.66,
          "en": "on this selectTopic key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 217.98,
          "end": 222.57999999999998,
          "en": "And if we now save that and reload, this is our application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 222.57999999999998,
          "end": 226.6,
          "en": "and we can still pick and select the different topics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.6,
          "end": 229.53,
          "en": "So now this works without passing props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 229.53,
          "end": 232.79,
          "en": "through multiple components and without emitting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.79,
          "end": 235.67000000000002,
          "en": "our custom event through multiple components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.67000000000002,
          "end": 237.763,
          "en": "It's simply a different approach.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
